# Platform versions

Align with repo files — not chat memory.

| Layer | Version | Where |
|-------|---------|-------|
| Java | **21** | `pom.xml` `java.version` |
| Spring Boot | **3.3.3** | parent POM |
| Node (Maven build) | **22.12.0** | `pom.xml` |
| Angular | **21.2.x** | `ui/package.json` |
| PrimeNG | **21.x** | `ui/package.json` |
| TypeScript | **~5.9** | `ui/package.json` |

LXC runtime may use **Java 25** (Temurin from moneytree base); keep bytecode/target at 21 unless pom is updated.

Build UI with `@angular/build:application` (not legacy browser builder).
